Note on bundled datasets:

This repository redistributes two publicly available datasets for
reproducibility:

  - Adult Census Income (UCI Machine Learning Repository), Donor: Ronny Kohavi
    and Barry Becker. Available under the UCI ML repository terms.
    See data/adult.csv and the original source at
    https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/2/adult

  - COMPAS Recidivism Risk Score (ProPublica). Released under the
    Creative Commons license by ProPublica's analysis at
    https://github.com/propublica/compas-analysis

Use of these datasets is subject to their respective original licenses, not the
MIT license that governs the code in this repository.
